    "detailed_description": "<h1>MEANDERS - NEW LEVELS AVAILABLE!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800300/extras/57ec61d68ae459f19f72918cb384afb4.poster.avif?t=1569935578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800300/extras/57ec61d68ae459f19f72918cb384afb4.webm?t=1569935578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800300/extras/57ec61d68ae459f19f72918cb384afb4.mp4?t=1569935578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LIGHT CREATES, DARKNESS DESTROYS</strong></h2><br>such is the way of the flickering world of GLIGHT, teetering between reality and illusion.<br><br>The peculiar black and white art style emphasizes and gives form to several abilities affecting platform and gameplay mechanics, giving visual representation to your powers to shape and control reality.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HOWEVER VAST IS THE DARKNESS...</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800300/extras/9a890f5eb73bf1bc4a3ced0fc302f98a.avif?t=1569935578\" /></div><br><strong>What you currently see here is just a prototype, and doesn't represent the final game.</strong><br>Glight was submitted as an entry for the &quot;Epic Mega Jam 2017&quot;.<br>We will develop Glight into a full game and then release it here on STEAM!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800300/extras/57ec61d68ae459f19f72918cb384afb4.poster.avif?t=1569935578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800300/extras/57ec61d68ae459f19f72918cb384afb4.webm?t=1569935578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800300/extras/57ec61d68ae459f19f72918cb384afb4.mp4?t=1569935578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LIGHT CREATES, DARKNESS DESTROYS</strong></h2><br>such is the way of the flickering world of GLIGHT, teetering between reality and illusion.<br><br>The peculiar black and white art style emphasizes and gives form to several abilities affecting platform and gameplay mechanics, giving visual representation to your powers to shape and control reality.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HOWEVER VAST IS THE DARKNESS...</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/800300/extras/9a890f5eb73bf1bc4a3ced0fc302f98a.avif?t=1569935578\" /></div><br><strong>What you currently see here is just a prototype, and doesn't represent the final game.</strong><br>Glight was submitted as an entry for the &quot;Epic Mega Jam 2017&quot;.<br>We will develop Glight into a full game and then release it here on STEAM!",
